# This repository publishes only the patch a player installs. Everything else in
# this working directory - the extraction/build toolchain, the term tables that
# carry the game's verbatim Japanese and English script, the compiled intermediates
# and the game install itself - stays on the build machine.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/release/
/release/*
!/release/FM2RZhPatch/
!/release/FM2RZhPatch/**
